.DS_Store
.Rhistory
.RData
aDNA.code-workspace
__pycache__
.snakemake/
*.bkp

# pastForward CLI (workflow/scripts/cli.py): .pastforward/ holds the tracked-run state file,
# logs/ holds timestamped run/dryrun logs - both per project root.
.pastforward/
/logs/

# Synthetic test library materialized by tests/build_test_library.py (rebuilt on every
# test run - see tests/README.md).
tests/fixtures/

# A project's own config/config.yaml is the user's, never the repo's. The pattern has no
# leading slash, so it matches at any depth - including the workflow profile shipped with the
# pipeline, which is a config.yaml by necessity (Snakemake 9.9.0 accepts no other name) and
# must be tracked.
config.yaml
!workflow/profiles/default/config.yaml